WEBVTT

00:08.840 --> 00:15.440
<b>Dareka ga sutete-shimatta
kinou o hiroi-age</b>

00:15.440 --> 00:18.780
<b>Gamushara ni te o nobashita</b>

00:18.780 --> 00:22.080
<b>Kotae o tsukitsukete</b>

00:22.080 --> 00:27.550
<b>Nani o te ni iretemo manzoku
suru koto wa nai</b>

00:28.720 --> 00:34.660
<b>Fukuzatsu ni karanda kokoro no
sukima kara nigedase</b>

00:34.660 --> 00:36.730
<b>Sou sa, make a treasure</b>

00:36.730 --> 00:41.970
<b>Sabitsuita toki no naka ni kimi no koe o kiku</b>

00:41.970 --> 00:45.010
<b>Kono mama todoketai</b>

00:45.010 --> 00:48.280
<b>Hikari no naka kimi ga matteru</b>

00:48.280 --> 00:51.910
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

00:51.910 --> 00:55.510
<b>Ima sugu ni</b>

01:06.090 --> 01:08.130
<b>Dakara, make a treasure</b>

01:08.130 --> 01:13.370
<b>Sabitsuita kagami no naka jibun o sagashite</b>

01:13.370 --> 01:16.470
<b>Kono te de tsukamitai</b>

01:16.470 --> 01:19.710
<b>Doko ni itemo kimi ga matteru</b>

01:19.710 --> 01:23.280
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

01:23.280 --> 01:25.940
<b>Ima sugu ni</b>

01:57.980 --> 01:59.450
<b>So, that's it?</b>

02:00.350 --> 02:01.820
<b>The Tower of Konran.</b>

02:02.550 --> 02:04.520
<b>There seems to be no mistake about it.</b>

02:04.520 --> 02:06.380
<b>That's where those guys are, right?!</b>

02:09.590 --> 02:11.060
<b>Let's go!</b>

02:14.230 --> 02:15.700
<b>They're here.</b>

02:35.650 --> 02:39.420
<b>Creating a new Heaven and Earth,
that's our goal.</b>

02:40.320 --> 02:41.790
<b>However...</b>

02:43.230 --> 02:48.420
<b>What will there be after the Heaven and
Earth have been founded?</b>

02:51.830 --> 02:53.460
<b>Am I having second thoughts?</b>

02:56.910 --> 02:58.370
<b>Impossible.</b>

03:01.510 --> 03:05.950
<b>I negated all of my doubts
at that moment back then.</b>

03:11.550 --> 03:17.720
<b>Yes, at that moment I decided
to follow Homura.</b>

03:25.230 --> 03:26.700
<b>Nataku...</b>

03:30.740 --> 03:34.110
<b>We're rebelling against the Heavens</b>

03:34.110 --> 03:37.510
<b>and trying to create a new world.</b>

03:39.780 --> 03:43.050
<b>If you hadn't shut your heart away...</b>

03:53.600 --> 03:57.030
<b>I suppose you'll come to stop us after all.</b>

04:00.070 --> 04:01.540
<b>It's starting.</b>

04:02.170 --> 04:03.640
<b>I understand.</b>

04:11.980 --> 04:19.280
<b>Konzen Douji, Field Marshal Tenpou,
General Kenren, and Son Goku.</b>

04:20.220 --> 04:26.560
<b>Perhaps they too are sorrowful beings,
who have been deeply hurt.</b>

04:28.660 --> 04:32.570
<b>A world without sorrows such as they and
we have suffered,</b>

04:32.570 --> 04:35.040
<b>perhaps that will be enough.</b>

04:38.140 --> 04:40.510
<b>Hakkai, charge straight on in!</b>

04:40.510 --> 04:42.640
<b>That was my plan from the start!</b>

04:42.640 --> 04:44.340
<b>Go!</b>

04:45.080 --> 04:46.780
<b>Well, well, how grand of us!</b>

04:47.820 --> 04:49.750
<b>Not that I hate this sort of thing.</b>

04:50.320 --> 04:51.980
<b>Here we go, Hakuryu!</b>

05:10.870 --> 05:14.740
<b>Quiet, isn't it? Almost unnaturally so.</b>

05:15.540 --> 05:17.010
<b>A trap, maybe?</b>

05:17.580 --> 05:22.180
<b>It doesn't matter. Besides, even if it
is a trap or something...</b>

05:22.180 --> 05:24.090
<b>We have no choice but to go anyway.</b>

05:24.090 --> 05:25.550
<b>You got it!</b>

05:29.120 --> 05:30.610
<b>And here they are already.</b>

05:31.530 --> 05:34.430
<b>But this aura, it's not Homura and the others.</b>

05:34.430 --> 05:37.260
<b>I've been waiting for you, Genjo Sanzo.</b>

05:38.730 --> 05:41.000
<b>I don't recall setting up a meeting.</b>

05:42.440 --> 05:46.210
<b>My name's Gairu, leader of the
Holy Demon Army.</b>

05:46.210 --> 05:50.450
<b>By Lord Homura's orders, I'll give you death.</b>

05:50.450 --> 05:55.320
<b>No thanks, I don't want any
presents from a guy.</b>

05:55.320 --> 05:56.780
<b>I can't allow that.</b>

06:02.860 --> 06:05.560
<b>You'll receive it, whether you like it or not.</b>

06:05.560 --> 06:08.090
<b>I've had enough of your delusions,
you small fry!</b>

06:08.800 --> 06:12.500
<b>You should've waited another ten billion
years before fighting us!</b>

06:12.500 --> 06:16.530
<b>Well, a little lively action is probably
necessary too.</b>

06:17.070 --> 06:22.540
<b>Move out of the way. Our business isn't
with you guys, just Homura!</b>

06:22.540 --> 06:24.480
<b>What if I say no?</b>

06:26.250 --> 06:27.420
<b>We'll kill you.</b>

06:27.420 --> 06:28.880
<b>Get them!</b>

06:50.210 --> 06:51.670
<b>It can't be!</b>

07:00.720 --> 07:04.480
<b>It seems I'll need to hurry.</b>

07:07.320 --> 07:09.310
<b>What is this? Did something happen?</b>

07:10.430 --> 07:11.890
<b>No.</b>

07:27.980 --> 07:29.500
<b>Four distinct individuals.</b>

07:31.210 --> 07:34.520
<b>At first glance, they seem
completely incongruous,</b>

07:34.520 --> 07:37.190
<b>but they compensate for each other's
weaknesses, harmonizing,</b>

07:37.190 --> 07:39.020
<b>intensifying their brilliance together.</b>

07:41.520 --> 07:42.960
<b>Genjo Sanzo...</b>

07:45.230 --> 07:46.690
<b>Cho Hakkai...</b>

07:49.230 --> 07:50.700
<b>Sha Gojyo...</b>

07:51.570 --> 07:53.030
<b>And...</b>

07:53.840 --> 07:55.430
<b>Son Goku.</b>

07:56.910 --> 07:58.970
<b>Born from a rock on Mount Kaka,</b>

07:58.970 --> 08:01.310
<b>a golden-eyed being of heresy.</b>

08:02.740 --> 08:04.510
<b>The one and only unique existence.</b>

08:08.550 --> 08:12.180
<b>We need to obtain Goku.</b>

08:14.460 --> 08:18.960
<b>Everything has been in preparation
for this day after all.</b>

08:18.960 --> 08:21.200
<b>Basically, you need his power</b>

08:21.200 --> 08:23.660
<b>in order to create the new
Heaven and Earth, right?</b>

08:25.730 --> 08:27.200
<b>That's right.</b>

08:28.170 --> 08:30.240
<b>According to the reports we've received,</b>

08:30.240 --> 08:33.980
<b>it seems Sanzo's group has
already entered the tower.</b>

08:33.980 --> 08:37.000
<b>He'll come here, even if we
leave him to his own devices.</b>

08:37.850 --> 08:41.510
<b>Well, that's if he doesn't get
killed on the way.</b>

08:42.320 --> 08:46.550
<b>It'll be problematic if he can't
even get this far though.</b>

08:46.550 --> 08:49.920
<b>Don't worry. He'll come without fail!</b>

08:52.360 --> 08:53.830
<b>Without fail!</b>

08:56.630 --> 08:58.600
<b>Son Goku,</b>

08:58.600 --> 09:01.500
<b>one who can perceive the void, that
which can't be seen with the eye.</b>

09:02.940 --> 09:05.270
<b>I'll obtain you, no matter what.</b>

09:18.620 --> 09:20.220
<b>Here I was wondering how
tough you might be,</b>

09:20.220 --> 09:22.520
<b>since you said you were Homura's minions.</b>

09:22.520 --> 09:26.050
<b>No kidding! It was almost TOO easy.</b>

09:26.590 --> 09:30.090
<b>It seems we've largely taken care of them.</b>

09:30.870 --> 09:32.530
<b>All that's left</b>

09:32.530 --> 09:33.970
<b>is you.</b>

09:34.970 --> 09:36.900
<b>Are you sure about that?</b>

09:36.900 --> 09:38.370
<b>What?!</b>

09:52.350 --> 09:53.980
<b>No way! Is this for real?!</b>

09:54.590 --> 09:56.180
<b>I never imagined such a trick!</b>

09:56.890 --> 09:58.690
<b>No wonder they were so weak.</b>

10:00.930 --> 10:03.970
<b>Lord Homura bestowed upon us eternal life</b>

10:03.970 --> 10:06.530
<b>and absolute power!</b>

10:07.870 --> 10:13.140
<b>We can't possibly be defeated
by such lowly scum as you!</b>

10:16.640 --> 10:19.050
<b>Man, what a pain!</b>

10:19.050 --> 10:21.240
<b>This has certainly turned
into an ugly situation.</b>

10:29.890 --> 10:32.420
<b>The significance of this pentagram...</b>

10:33.730 --> 10:38.130
<b>It signifies the powers necessary to
found Heaven and Earth.</b>

10:39.270 --> 10:41.460
<b>One is the Maten Scripture.</b>

10:42.440 --> 10:45.270
<b>Another is the Seiten Scripture.</b>

10:46.110 --> 10:49.630
<b>And for the remaining three Scriptures,</b>

10:51.210 --> 10:53.540
<b>we three will take their places.</b>

11:03.520 --> 11:06.960
<b>So, this is what it is to found
Heaven and Earth.</b>

11:06.960 --> 11:08.430
<b>What incredible power!</b>

11:09.430 --> 11:12.770
<b>The power from each point is
resonating, being intensified,</b>

11:12.770 --> 11:15.470
<b>and then collected into the center.</b>

11:15.470 --> 11:19.010
<b>It's not only our power.</b>

11:19.010 --> 11:22.840
<b>It feels as though power from the entire world</b>

11:22.840 --> 11:26.080
<b>is directed towards the center
of the pentagram through us.</b>

11:27.180 --> 11:31.170
<b>This is amazing. All we've done
is come to stand in our places.</b>

11:31.890 --> 11:34.160
<b>This is how much power is necessary</b>

11:34.160 --> 11:36.490
<b>in order to create a new Heaven and Earth.</b>

11:37.860 --> 11:39.790
<b>That's what this means, is it not?</b>

11:39.790 --> 11:41.460
<b>That's right.</b>

11:41.460 --> 11:45.700
<b>And when we place Son Goku,
the spirit of the great Earth,</b>

11:45.700 --> 11:47.800
<b>in the center of the pentagram,</b>

11:47.800 --> 11:52.170
<b>a new Heaven and Earth will come forth
to supplant Shangri-La.</b>

11:57.650 --> 11:59.610
<b>Come quickly, Son Goku.</b>

12:00.350 --> 12:02.020
<b>All that remains</b>

12:02.020 --> 12:03.450
<b>is you!</b>

12:04.990 --> 12:06.450
<b>How could this be?!</b>

12:08.720 --> 12:10.260
<b>Reporting in, Sir!</b>

12:10.260 --> 12:12.090
<b>An enormous energy reading
has been detected</b>

12:12.090 --> 12:14.760
<b>from the Tower of Konran in the Lower World!</b>

12:14.760 --> 12:18.200
<b>War Prince Homura's suspected
of this treachery!</b>

12:18.200 --> 12:21.640
<b>At this rate, there's a chance the Lower
World will be swallowed up</b>

12:21.640 --> 12:23.640
<b>and a new Heaven and Earth will be created.</b>

12:23.640 --> 12:26.900
<b>Why?! Why was this not noted earlier?!</b>

12:28.140 --> 12:29.780
<b>An emergency summons!</b>

12:29.780 --> 12:32.210
<b>Gather all the high-ranking members!</b>

12:33.950 --> 12:35.420
<b>So, it's begun.</b>

12:38.950 --> 12:44.060
<b>Seeing them panic right on schedule
rather dampens the fun really.</b>

12:44.060 --> 12:48.190
<b>Merciful Goddess, what are you doing here?!</b>

12:48.760 --> 12:50.320
<b>Isn't it obvious?</b>

12:51.470 --> 12:55.770
<b>I'm standing witness to what
they do with their lives.</b>

12:55.770 --> 12:57.410
<b>What leisurely nonsense is that?!</b>

12:57.410 --> 13:01.840
<b>You should be well aware of the
significance of this situation!</b>

13:01.840 --> 13:03.310
<b>Of course.</b>

13:03.910 --> 13:05.950
<b>After all, though the Heavens are vast,</b>

13:05.950 --> 13:10.020
<b>I was the only one who knew
this would happen.</b>

13:10.020 --> 13:11.710
<b>Merciful Goddess!</b>

13:12.450 --> 13:16.390
<b>The screenplay was drawn
up a long time ago.</b>

13:16.390 --> 13:21.000
<b>Don't you think objecting to it
at this late date is absurd?</b>

13:21.000 --> 13:23.130
<b>But...</b>

13:23.130 --> 13:26.730
<b>Basically, it just means those
guys weren't the sort</b>

13:26.730 --> 13:30.230
<b>who could stand to hang
around this boring place.</b>

13:32.740 --> 13:34.940
<b>It looks like it'll get interesting.</b>

13:35.710 --> 13:37.180
<b>Merciful Goddess.</b>

13:37.750 --> 13:41.250
<b>I know, I just have to go, right?</b>

13:41.250 --> 13:42.420
<b>Lady?</b>

13:42.420 --> 13:43.880
<b>Let's go, Jiroushin.</b>

13:45.120 --> 13:47.310
<b>We have to go tell some idiots</b>

13:48.120 --> 13:50.190
<b>just what it is we ought to do.</b>

13:50.190 --> 13:53.720
<b>Merciful Goddess, you go too far
in what you say!</b>

13:54.860 --> 14:00.000
<b>Konzen, leave matters here to me and
give it all you've got,</b>

14:00.000 --> 14:02.200
<b>doing things in your own way.</b>

14:04.910 --> 14:07.140
<b>Hey, did you just say something?</b>

14:07.140 --> 14:09.040
<b>No, nothing.</b>

14:09.040 --> 14:11.410
<b>Hey, now, you okay?</b>

14:11.410 --> 14:15.750
<b>Master Sanzo's still on the mend,
so he has auditory hallucinations.</b>

14:16.920 --> 14:18.390
<b>I'll kill you.</b>

14:22.120 --> 14:24.960
<b>Bastard, what if you actually hit me?!</b>

14:24.960 --> 14:28.560
<b>What kind of attitude is that after
I just saved your butt?</b>

14:28.560 --> 14:31.700
<b>Who asked you to?! Maybe it was more
hallucinations or something!</b>

14:31.700 --> 14:33.170
<b>You scruffy monk!</b>

14:34.470 --> 14:36.040
<b>What did you call me?</b>

14:36.040 --> 14:39.370
<b>Whoa, whoa, both of you, calm down.</b>

14:41.510 --> 14:43.840
<b>Who cares about that?!
What're we going to do?!</b>

14:43.840 --> 14:45.810
<b>There's just as many of them as before!</b>

14:46.550 --> 14:50.510
<b>Killing them normally just leaves them
coming back to life right away.</b>

14:52.820 --> 14:54.290
<b>If we're to kill them,</b>

14:54.290 --> 14:56.420
<b>either we chop them up until
they can't be resurrected...</b>

14:56.420 --> 14:59.520
<b>Or instantaneously vaporize them
at the molecular level.</b>

15:00.390 --> 15:03.460
<b>Perfect for buying time, right?</b>

15:03.460 --> 15:05.020
<b>For Homura...</b>

15:06.400 --> 15:09.230
<b>He's a cunning bastard all right!</b>

15:13.710 --> 15:15.270
<b>Can you see it, Rinrei?</b>

15:17.210 --> 15:19.340
<b>This is the world we dreamed of.</b>

15:22.620 --> 15:25.680
<b>Neither restrictions nor taboos exist here.</b>

15:26.490 --> 15:30.750
<b>There's freedom, completely
unfettered freedom.</b>

15:38.130 --> 15:39.600
<b>Let's start.</b>

16:00.020 --> 16:01.160
<b>What the?!</b>

16:01.160 --> 16:02.990
<b>It's from above!</b>

16:02.990 --> 16:06.430
<b>We can sense the enormous flow of chi,
even from this far away.</b>

16:07.260 --> 16:09.700
<b>Just what the hell are those guys up to?</b>

16:12.670 --> 16:17.430
<b>I guess their talk of wrecking the
Heavens wasn't necessarily a lie.</b>

16:18.270 --> 16:20.510
<b>Man, you've got to be kidding me.</b>

16:20.510 --> 16:23.170
<b>It seems we really must get moving then.</b>

16:24.710 --> 16:27.980
<b>What're you looking at?! Your
opponents are over here!</b>

16:29.380 --> 16:30.850
<b>Shut up!</b>

16:39.030 --> 16:43.930
<b>No one likes persistent guys, not to
mention weak ones to boot.</b>

16:43.930 --> 16:46.260
<b>This is endless! What're we
going to do, Sanzo?!</b>

16:46.900 --> 16:48.770
<b>That's easy for you to ask.</b>

16:48.770 --> 16:52.100
<b>Sanzo, I have a good strategy in mind.</b>

16:53.110 --> 16:54.510
<b>Let's hear it.</b>

16:54.510 --> 16:58.700
<b>Leave this to me, and the rest
of you head upstairs.</b>

17:00.410 --> 17:02.450
<b>A brilliant plan.</b>

17:02.450 --> 17:05.750
<b>Isn't it? I think it's rather grand,
if I do say so myself.</b>

17:07.120 --> 17:09.320
<b>Are you saying this seriously?</b>

17:10.060 --> 17:12.890
<b>I didn't entirely say it in jest.</b>

17:13.530 --> 17:15.760
<b>Hakkai, are you...</b>

17:20.300 --> 17:21.970
<b>There's no time.</b>

17:21.970 --> 17:25.200
<b>Please leave things here
to me and go on ahead.</b>

17:26.640 --> 17:28.510
<b>No use arguing, is there?</b>

17:31.310 --> 17:34.480
<b>Did you hear that? So, that's the deal.</b>

17:34.480 --> 17:37.120
<b>That's the deal?! What do you mean?!</b>

17:37.120 --> 17:40.720
<b>Are you nuts? What the heck are you
going to do on your own?</b>

17:40.720 --> 17:42.260
<b>Don't worry.</b>

17:42.260 --> 17:44.820
<b>I alone will be more than enough
to deal with things here.</b>

17:46.530 --> 17:48.320
<b>More than enough? Are you...</b>

17:49.030 --> 17:52.520
<b>Gojyo, Goku, please trust me.</b>

17:54.000 --> 17:54.770
<b>Let's go!</b>

17:54.770 --> 17:56.560
<b>Hey, wait a minute, Sanzo!</b>

17:57.370 --> 18:00.100
<b>Aw, hell. We'll trust you, Hakkai.</b>

18:00.740 --> 18:03.140
<b>Yes. Oh, Gojyo?</b>

18:04.280 --> 18:05.940
<b>Please take care of Hakuryu for me.</b>

18:07.780 --> 18:10.910
<b>I may end up killing him if he's close by.</b>

18:12.620 --> 18:13.590
<b>Don't die now.</b>

18:13.590 --> 18:15.590
<b>I'll catch up with you right away.</b>

18:15.590 --> 18:16.520
<b>You're not getting away!</b>

18:16.520 --> 18:18.820
<b>I'm your opponent now.</b>

18:19.460 --> 18:23.730
<b>I'm sorry, but I can't allow
you to get past me.</b>

18:27.500 --> 18:29.100
<b>Are you sure about this, Sanzo?!</b>

18:29.100 --> 18:31.070
<b>Shut up, you noisy pest!</b>

18:31.070 --> 18:32.640
<b>But!</b>

18:32.640 --> 18:34.110
<b>There it is.</b>

18:34.740 --> 18:35.440
<b>Let's go.</b>

18:35.440 --> 18:36.610
<b>No!
Let's go.</b>

18:36.610 --> 18:36.910
<b>No!
What did you say?</b>

18:36.910 --> 18:38.110
<b>What did you say?</b>

18:38.110 --> 18:39.810
<b>Because there's something wrong here!</b>

18:39.810 --> 18:42.550
<b>How could you leave Hakkai behind?!</b>

18:42.550 --> 18:45.120
<b>He's the one who volunteered.</b>

18:45.120 --> 18:46.390
<b>Just because...</b>

18:46.390 --> 18:46.620
<b>That's enough!
Just because...</b>

18:46.620 --> 18:47.850
<b>That's enough!</b>

18:49.490 --> 18:52.820
<b>Weren't you listening to what he said?!</b>

18:54.530 --> 18:59.400
<b>Gojyo, Goku, please trust me.</b>

19:00.870 --> 19:02.340
<b>Hey, Goku.</b>

19:03.500 --> 19:07.700
<b>Hakkai told me that he'd catch up right away.</b>

19:08.640 --> 19:10.130
<b>Let's go!</b>

19:11.050 --> 19:12.510
<b>Hakkai...</b>

19:19.690 --> 19:23.620
<b>I'm rather reluctant to do this,
but this is no time to be picky.</b>

19:24.330 --> 19:26.430
<b>Have you lost your senses?</b>

19:26.430 --> 19:28.360
<b>We're immortal.</b>

19:28.360 --> 19:30.500
<b>You had your hands full,
even with four of you.</b>

19:30.500 --> 19:32.800
<b>What do you think to accomplish alone?</b>

19:33.900 --> 19:35.430
<b>You'll know soon enough.</b>

19:36.500 --> 19:42.110
<b>Of course, I believe it'll be too late
by the time you find out.</b>

19:42.110 --> 19:43.580
<b>Too late?</b>

19:44.450 --> 19:47.850
<b>I could say the very same thing of you.</b>

19:48.580 --> 19:50.640
<b>Your life will end, here and now!</b>

19:53.120 --> 19:54.590
<b>Then...</b>

19:56.390 --> 19:57.860
<b>Shall we get started?</b>

19:59.060 --> 20:00.550
<b>Kill him!</b>

20:46.110 --> 20:54.910
<b>Yukikau hito wa mina omoi nimotsu seotte</b>

20:56.280 --> 21:06.720
<b>Touku ni yureru kagerou
no naka ni ashita o mitsukeru</b>

21:08.060 --> 21:18.170
<b>Kono te o kobore-ochiru
suna no you na kanjou</b>

21:19.510 --> 21:32.490
<b>Ano toki mune ni sasatta
kotoba ga fui ni uzuku kedo</b>

21:32.490 --> 21:43.930
<b>Hatenai yoru o kazoenagara
jibun no kakera sagashite ita</b>

21:43.930 --> 21:55.210
<b>Ushinau hodo ni kono omoi
ga tashika ni natteku</b>

21:55.210 --> 22:07.380
<b>Ima nara kitto aruite yukeru doko made mo</b>
